---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import body from '../../../generated/agents/article.html?raw';
import '../../../styles/agents.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Your Agent Passed the Test. Then the Business Changed." description="An interactive field guide to Databricks agents, AI Runtime, open-model serving, and the evidence needed to improve a business outcome." article ogImage="/agents/og.png">
  <article class="ag" id="agent-article">
    <header class="ag-hero">
      <p class="ag-eyebrow">Systems for agents / An interactive field guide</p>
      <h1>Your agent passed the test.<br /><em>Then the business changed.</em></h1>
      <p class="ag-deck">Where Databricks, AI Runtime, and open models meet the reality of a changing business.</p>
      <div class="ag-byline"><span>Praneeth Paikray</span><time datetime="2026-10-31">31 October 2026</time><span>20 min + six explorations</span></div>
      <div class="ag-hero-map" aria-label="The learning loop: business context, agent actions, verified outcomes, and model adaptation">
        <div class="ag-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span class="orbit-dot od1"></span><span class="orbit-dot od2"></span><span class="orbit-dot od3"></span><div class="orbit-core">The business<br /><strong>keeps moving.</strong></div></div>
        <div class="orbit-label ol1"><small>01 / KNOW</small><strong>Current context</strong><span>Policies · permissions · state</span></div>
        <div class="orbit-label ol2"><small>02 / ACT</small><strong>Agent + open model</strong><span>Reason · call tools · verify</span></div>
        <div class="orbit-label ol3"><small>03 / LEARN</small><strong>Outcomes → adaptation</strong><span>Trace · evaluate · train · serve</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="ag-status"><span class="status-dot"></span>Technical explainer &amp; experiment design. Browser demos are deterministic illustrations, not model runs. No training or benchmark results are claimed.</p>
    </header>
    <nav class="ag-nav" aria-label="Article sections"><a href="#change">01 Change</a><a href="#trace">02 Observe</a><a href="#architecture">03 Connect</a><a href="#data">04 Adapt</a><a href="#evaluate">05 Prove</a><a href="#economics">06 Serve</a></nav>
    <div class="ag-body" set:html={body}></div>
    <footer class="ag-end"><p>Better agents begin with better evidence.</p><a href="/">← All writing</a><a href="#agent-article">Back to top ↑</a></footer>
  </article>
  <script is:inline type="module" src="/agents/explorers.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
